.env*
load-result.json

# Agent configuration is part of the project (AGENTS.md §7): rules, subagents, hooks and
# permissions are reviewed like any other source. A global gitignore commonly carries
# `.claude/`, which would silently drop all of it, so it is re-included here. Anything
# genuinely local belongs in .claude/settings.local.json, excluded below.
!.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent worktrees are checkouts of this repository, never content of it.
.claude/worktrees/
